          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:850bbf5c21f348feae250d8ff5ca95a4ea187a3994895fdc41f93f54eff30720:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_031b479dd2374ea18a2a64ab8065890a",
      "statement": "The SearchFilters component is the faceted input panel rendering every filter as an input control: Svelecte multi-selects for roaster/roaster-location/origin, text Inputs with 500ms debounced search for query/tasting-notes/region/producer/farm/roast-level/process/variety, numeric range inputs for price/weight/elevation, radio buttons for the tri-state decaf and single-origin filters, and checkboxes for roast profile (Filter/Espresso with an 'Include omni roasts' sub-option that always includes 'Both' in the query). All filter props are $bindable, propagating changes to searchStore via onSearch. FilterTags displays active filters as dismissible chips with per-filter removal and clear-all handlers. SearchResults renders the result grid with sort controls, the sort order button cycling desc->asc->random, and useBulkPrice when sorting by price_large.",
