    {
      "id": "claim_50f25bef29314923acc550eb653ab16b",
      "statement": "The roaster filter options in SearchFilters are dynamically narrowed by the selected roaster location: filteredRoasterOptions filters allRoasters to those whose location_codes include any selected roasterLocationFilter code (uppercased), and the roaster Svelecte placeholder updates to show the resolved location display name(s). The effectiveOriginOptions augmentation adds any active originFilter values not in the provided originOptions (e.g. country codes with no beans in the database) so they still display in the dropdown.",
