    {
      "id": "claim_f41cee04f420443ea8d4e5f61f68757e",
      "statement": "Price filters and display respect the user's selected currency via convert_to_currency. The searchStore.buildSearchParams() appends convert_to_currency from currencyState.selectedCurrency. The backend validates the currency code (must be a 3-letter ISO 4217 code), and if non-USD converts min_price/max_price from the target currency to USD using convert_price() before building the range filter. The main query's SELECT uses _build_currency_select_sql() to project the price in the requested currency and mark price_converted.",
