    {
      "id": "claim_e38a0bfcfea54d009e134336f2548bd6",
      "statement": "The dropdown option lists (originOptions for countries, allRoasters with location_codes, roasterLocationOptions for hierarchical location codes) are fetched once in the parent +layout.ts load function via three parallel API calls (getCountries, getRoasters, getRoasterLocations) and passed as props through the page to SearchFilters, SearchResults, and FilterTags for label resolution. They are not re-fetched on every search.",
