      "id": "claim_8de7e6e64b804013a8845bbc3496bc0a",
      "statement": "Search result cards link to the bean detail page via href='/roasters' + bean.bean_url_path, making the faceted filtering system the primary discovery funnel into the bean detail page. Results are rendered in an InfiniteLoader that triggers loadMore when the scroll sentinel approaches the viewport, with results partitioned into 'matching' (score >= maxPossibleScore) and 'Similar beans' (score < maxPossibleScore) sections in relevance mode.",
