    {
      "id": "claim_ffe18a4dcbe544de917a30dc0508a6a1",
      "statement": "The SmartSearch component provides an AI-powered natural-language entry point that feeds into the same searchStore pipeline. searchStore.performSmartSearch() calls the AI search API, which returns structured SearchParams that overwrite the current filter state, then triggers performNewSearch(). If the AI service is rate-limited, the store falls back to an FTS query with sortBy='relevance' and surfaces the rate-limit reset time. The SearchResults component computes a filterKey fingerprint of all filter values that SmartSearch uses to detect manual filter drift and hide the feedback row.",
