    {
      "id": "claim_050311879df54442a378b0602d3701fc",
      "statement": "APISearchResult extends APICoffeeBean with search-specific fields: date_added (when first scraped), score (the relevance score, only populated in relevance mode), price_large_weight (weight of largest bag in grams), price_large_price (price of largest bag in user's currency), and price_large_price_per_kg_usd (normalised price per kg in USD). The response is wrapped in APIResponse with success, data, message, pagination (PaginationInfo), and metadata fields.",
