    {
      "id": "claim_738295a7912843fcbeb1022bab3a1b74",
      "statement": "In relevance (scoring) mode, the roast level filter uses a closeness function on a 0-5 roast scale (Extra-Light=0 through Dark=5) rather than a simple match: exact match scores 1.0, one level apart scores 0.5, two levels apart scores 0.2. In strict mode it falls back to a boolean-search filter on cb.roast_level. The roast profile filter always uses a boolean-search filter on cb.roast_profile in both modes.",
